%% Every state carries the mandated FSM triple: label + icon + color + token-cost claim.
%% Every transition is labeled with the triggering threshold or event.
%% Solid arrows = promotion. Dashed arrows = demotion. Red-bordered callout = emergency.

stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR

  L0: L0 · 📋 registered<br/>~10t · cold storage
  L1: L1 · 📝 metadata<br/>~80t · low risk
  L2: L2 · 📄 synopsis<br/>~400t · low risk
  L3: L3 · 📖 full SKILL.md<br/>~3000-5000t · medium risk
  L4R: L4R · 🔍 resource read<br/>per-file · medium risk
  L4X: L4X · ⚡ script execute<br/>per-tool · HIGH risk

  [*] --> L0: registry seed

  %% ─────────── PROMOTIONS ───────────
  L0  --> L1:  registry scan + scope filter
  L1  --> L2:  score ≥ τ_syn_load=0.45
  L2  --> L3:  score ≥ τ_full_load=0.65 ∧ intent_to_invoke
  L3  --> L4R: referenced resource needed
  L3  --> L4X: executable needed ∧ capability_policy.admits(skill,tool)

  %% ─────────── DEMOTIONS ───────────
  L4X --> L3:  execution complete | policy revoked
  L4R --> L3:  resource no longer needed
  L3  --> L2:  idle≥N_full | score<τ_full_keep=0.40 | drift≥θ=0.35 | task_complete
  L2  --> L1:  idle≥N_syn | drift≥θ=0.35 | score<τ_syn_keep=0.30
  L1  --> L0:  registry_pressure ∧ rank_below_floor

  %% ─────────── EMERGENCY (any → L1) ───────────
  L3  --> L1: EP-001 · context_overflow ≥ 0.85
  L4X --> L1: EP-013 · framework integrity breach
